    "Phase 7 has seven visible rows but a total counter of ten. Three rows have unknown IDs, statuses and scores; no placeholder submissions are invented.",
    "Best scores are maxima over visible rows with status Finished, retaining all ties. They do not establish an overall best for hidden rows.",
    "Submission 973189 has status Cancelled and a displayed score of 0.4805; both are preserved and it is excluded from best-finished calculations.",
    "A green check mark is recorded as a visual observation only; leaderboard selection and final acceptance have not been independently verified.",
    "Per-row status is used. The repeated Running submission_8.zip banner is inconsistent with the Finished row for 1040827; phase availability banners are not treated as current schedule evidence.",
    "Submission counts do not establish distinct architectures or reproducibility. Four Phase 1 model labels were supplied by the project author on 8 November 2026 and matched to unique displayed scores (964722, 964717, 950906, 950394). Their exact code, checkpoint and method remain unknown; other Phase 1 model mappings remain null. Reported Conv 0.838 has no matching score in these screenshots.",
    "The project author confirmed the Phase 2 model and method for all 11 displayed submission IDs on 8 November 2026. The associated ZIPs, code commits and checkpoint references have not been supplied; row 973189 remains Cancelled despite its displayed score.",
    "Phase 3 model/method labels were supplied in a user-provided table on 8 November 2026. Nine rows have a model and method, including the two early LoRA rows identified as decoder-only 50M (985518) and LegalEncDec 50M (985411). Two rsLoRA labels are tentative and remain null in the machine-readable record, and 991374 has no mapping.",
    "Phase 3 model_family values use the canonical Phase 1 architecture names. The source mapping called the MoE model 'RoPE–GQA–MoE / SwiGLU' and the Conv run 'Conv, 50M'. The available Conv implementation is 90M, so the Phase 3 Conv row is not linked to that checkpoint.",
    "The user-supplied Phase 4 experiment table maps seven finished IDs to model and method. For 1003872, FunnelTransformer is teacher and RoPE–GQA–MoE is student. The initial table called 1003780 a Conv run; the project author later corrected it to RoPE–GQA–MoE prefix tuning. Submission 999931 and both cancelled runs remain without model attribution.",
    "Phase 5 model and method labels were supplied in a user-provided experiment table. For 1010669, the project author identified RoPE–GQA–MoE as teacher and Conv/hybrid as student.",
    "Phase 6 model and method labels were provided in a user-supplied experiment table. For 1019925 the project author specified RoPE–GQA–MoE teacher and Conv/hybrid student for upcoming phases. The 1021502 Pfeiffer adapter model was not identified.",
    "Original screenshots remain in the supplied chat attachments; source filenames and SHA-256 hashes identify the evidence. Images are not duplicated in this repository."
